==History==
2023
*The Terry [[Cards|card]] is released in the Super Champion Battle Event, which started on 1/5/2023.
*On 9/5/2023, the Terry was removed from the game.

==Trivia==
*The name "Terry" is a gender-neutral name of Middle English origins, meaning “''power of the tribe''”.
*The hog that he rides is most likely a "''Phacochoerus africanus''" ([https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_warthog common warthog]). Common warthogs are smaller than boars but more agile which might explain why Terry can move particularly fast. Warthogs also have tusks, which is like the Hog Rider's hog in Clash Royale.
*The Terry is inspired by a [[Hog Rider]] in [https://books-of-clash.fandom.com/wiki/Volume_1 Volume 1 of Books of Clash].
*Along with the [[Golden Knight]], [[Boss Bandit]], [[Archer Queen]], [[Mighty Miner]], and the [[Monk]], the Terry has the cheapest ability, costing 1 Elixir.
**Also along with the Golden Knight and the Mighty Miner, he also has the cheapest combined Elixir cost of {{Rarity|Champion}} and ability, costing 5 Elixir.
*The Terry is tied with Hog Rider, [[Royal Hogs]], [[Princess]], [[Mother Witch|Cursed Hog]], and [[Santa Hog Rider]] for the longest sight range of all [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]], with a sight range of 9.5 tiles.
*The Terry is the only {{Rarity|Champion}} card that only targets [[:Category:Building Cards|buildings]].
*The Terry is the first {{Rarity|Champion}} card to be temporary.
*When Terry is deployed, he will occasionally yell "''Hog Riderrrrr!''"
**The Terry is 1 of 24 troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Mega Minion]], [[Wizard]], Hog Rider, [[P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Dark Prince]], [[Bowler]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Electro Wizard]], Princess, [[Ice Wizard]], [[Magic Archer]], [[Lumberjack]], Mother Witch, [[Fisherman]], [[Goblin Machine]], [[Super Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], Santa Hog Rider, [[Super Magic Archer]], Golden Knight, Boss Bandit, Archer Queen, and the [[Little Prince]].
*The Terry is the subject of 2 [[Emotes]].

